い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>口<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けております。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">机组人员刚刚打开门。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">出来上がり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">できあがり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完成；完工；工艺；结果；成果</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200429\">どのくらいでこの<ruby>洗濯物<rp>(</rp><rt>せんたくもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>出来上<rp>(</rp><rt>できあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がりますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那么,洗衣机需要多长时间呢?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">出来上がる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">できあがる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完成；做好；准备好；烂醉；大醉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147702\"><ruby>出発<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっぱつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>準備<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅんび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はできあがっています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">出发准备好了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">凸凹</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">でこぼこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">凹凸不平；粗糙；崎岖；不平等；失衡；不均匀；差异</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198129\">バスはでこぼこ<ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りながらガタガタと<ruby